# Optional hello_lookup tool (tutorial advanced)

This file shows a minimal tool definition using the stable `@carina/core/tool` API.
Pack tools are not auto-registered in v0.2; npm-published packs wire tools in their package entry module.

```typescript
import { registerTool } from '@carina/core/tool';

export function registerHelloPackTools(): void {
  registerTool({
    name: 'hello_lookup',
    description: 'Return a demo greeting for a name (hello-pack tutorial)',
    parameters: {
      type: 'object',
      properties: {
        name: { type: 'string', description: 'Name to greet' },
      },
      required: ['name'],
    },
    async execute(params) {
      const name = String(params.name ?? 'friend');
      return { greeting: `Hello, ${name}! (from hello-pack demo tool)` };
    },
  });
}
```

For this tutorial, the `domain-greeting` skill works without a custom tool.
